# Presence of this file makes npm use it instead of .gitignore when packing.
# That is required: the repo-root (and a future package-root) .gitignore ignores
# `dist/`, and without an .npmignore that ignore would silently drop the built
# output from the tarball even though `files` lists `dist`.
#
# Patterns below exclude anything that might otherwise slip past the `files`
# allowlist. They do NOT need to restate what `files` already omits.
*.tsbuildinfo
.turbo
.storybook
storybook-static
coverage
*.log
